WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.421 --> 00:00:03.092
- With all of this week's negative news

00:00:03.092 --> 00:00:06.372
about the relationship between
the United States and Mexico,

00:00:06.372 --> 00:00:08.996
I've been thinking and I
thought I'd try and do something

00:00:08.996 --> 00:00:11.875
positive, so here's the plan.

00:00:11.875 --> 00:00:16.348
I'm gonna head down to Mexico
City, rent a television studio

00:00:16.348 --> 00:00:19.107
and shoot and episode of
our show with the help

00:00:19.107 --> 00:00:23.600
of an all Mexican staff, crew,
guests, and studio audience

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:26.737
and we're gonna call it
Conan Without Borders

00:00:26.737 --> 00:00:27.987
Made in Mexico.

00:00:29.108 --> 00:00:33.054
(applause and cheering)

00:00:33.054 --> 00:00:33.887
Yeah.

00:00:36.621 --> 00:00:39.773
We're gonna shoot it down
there and then this special

00:00:39.773 --> 00:00:43.940
is going to air on Wednesday,
March first and 10:00 pm,

00:00:44.964 --> 00:00:47.487
so you can watch what happens there.

00:00:47.487 --> 00:00:49.189
(applause and cheering)

00:00:49.189 --> 00:00:51.522
I am, I'm really fascinated.

00:00:52.393 --> 00:00:54.703
I'm looking forward to
who we're gonna meet,

00:00:54.703 --> 00:00:55.958
how it's all gonna work.

00:00:55.958 --> 00:00:57.737
- Right, you're basically outsourcing.

00:00:57.737 --> 00:00:58.939
- Yeah.

00:00:58.939 --> 00:00:59.983
(laughter)

00:00:59.983 --> 00:01:01.951
We're outsourcing the show for episode, or

00:01:01.951 --> 00:01:03.653
- Right, just for one episode.

00:01:03.653 --> 00:01:05.320
- Yeah, well yeah, just for one episode,

00:01:05.320 --> 00:01:06.316
but we'll see how it goes, you know.

00:01:06.316 --> 00:01:07.324
- [Andy] Oh wow!

00:01:07.324 --> 00:01:08.327
- You know, if it really

00:01:08.327 --> 00:01:09.323
- Everyone's on their toes.

00:01:09.323 --> 00:01:12.101
- If it really gels, maybe
that's where I'm meant to be,

00:01:12.101 --> 00:01:16.207
so yeah, so anyway, watch for
that show, I'm excited for it.

